Conclusion

The DIY Fighter Helicopter Model (Arduino-Based) was successfully designed, assembled, programmed, tested, and documented over 29 hours. This project improved my practical knowledge of Arduino programming, electronics, mechanical design, and technical documentation while demonstrating the complete development process of a hardware project.